(7406567, 1166696, 19825, '<td valign="top">I tend to have a personal bias toward images with people in them. I find adding people often makes the shot more interesting (for me anyway). There are few people to be found in this challenge. I like the relaxed mood this young man adds.</td>', 'I tend to have a personal bias toward images with people in them. I find adding people often makes the shot more interesting (for me anyway). There are few people to be found in this challenge. I like the relaxed mood this young man adds.', '2015-09-28 12:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
