(7406879, 1166645, 42256, '<td valign="top">I wish I could edit details in the comment section!<br/> <br/>This is Bear Lake in Rocky Mountain National Park.<br/>Its almost the same location where Richard''s (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54446" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hahn23</a>) beautiful shot is taken from. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1166684" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2163/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1166684.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2163/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1166684.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2163/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1166684.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>RMNP is amazing, this was our first visit to the park and Richard was really kind to suggest locations to photograph. <br/>Here are some more pictures from the trip - <a href="https://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.10153683112591554.1073741835.513216553&amp;type=1&amp;l=e8084af3dc" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Facebook - Colorado</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-09-30 09:44:54.</i></td>', 'I wish I could edit details in the comment section! This is Bear Lake in Rocky Mountain National Park.Its almost the same location where Richard''s ( hahn23) beautiful shot is taken from.   RMNP is amazing, this was our first visit to the park and Richard was really kind to suggest locations to photograph. Here are some more pictures from the trip - Facebook - Colorado', '2015-09-30 10:44:10.000000', '2015-09-30 10:44:54.000000', 0),
